  "method_changes": [
    "Assign and move assignment return destination; explicit self assignment and Clone::clone_from preserve destination bucket policy",
    "Integral template support added for i8/u8/i16/u16/isize/bool",
    "Native Size/Length and detached end iterator",
    "Explicit self Unite/Intersect/Subtract/Differ branches",
    "Iterator native cached STL key retained at end (last block base); legacy checked Key/Value still raise",
    "Iterator constructor, assignment, prefix/post increment, IsEqual and arrow pointer to owned cached key"
  ],
  "remaining_gaps": [
    "Private BasicIterator alias reachability needs compiler proof for public STL API credit",
    "Raw pointer returned by iterator is invalidated when the Rust iterator moves, as native object relocation also changes member addresses",
    "Borrowed iteration disallows mutation; separate detached PackedCursor handles only established safe native mutation cases",
    "Three-operand set operation destination-alias permutations are not all represented by dedicated Rust APIs",
    "C++ allocator hooks, raw native node exposure and exact allocation-failure behavior remain outside this implementation",
    "No compiler body capture or integrated main credit in this scoped audit"
  ]
}
